## `caches`, `SharedWorker` (one worker per script and name on the page, a
## port per connection, all over the one message channel), `importScripts`
## for scripts the worker names with string literals (the page fetches them
## first) and service workers with install and activate, but no fetch
## events. Not yet: module workers, transfer of buffers and ports (they are
## copied or refused), nested workers.

